# ACJ SciCalcJava Project

Anitra, Collin and Joe worked to write code for a small app to function as a calculator. 

## Description

Our team built this program to exercise lessons and coding discussed during our first week at Zip Code Wilmington.
We were charged with coding a calculator that could execute basic mathematical equations, including squaring and square root functioning. We forked repositories in Github and used VS Code to work.
Initial challenges included not knowing where or how to start. We used Claude to explain concepts and provide examples.

